      "short_description": "Relaxed neighborhood bar and cafe serving classic comfort food, cocktails and late-night bites with beers, pool tables and sports on TV.",
      "number_of_stations": null,
      "cuisine_description": "Catman Cafe is a neighborhood establishment serving classic American comfort food in a casual setting. Signature menu items include Prime Rib, steak tips, burgers, and baked haddock. The restaurant features a full bar offering beer, wine, spirits, and specialty cocktails, and provides both dine-in, takeout, and delivery services.",
      "overall_description": "This long-standing establishment serves as a pillar of the local community, offering a reliable, unpretentious environment for comfort food and social gatherings. It balances a casual bar vibe with a robust menu that includes signature prime rib and steak tips. With amenities like pool tables, sports coverage, and karaoke, it remains a popular destination for those seeking a relaxed place to eat, drink, and socialize with friends.",
      "service_description": "The restaurant offers dine-in, takeout, and delivery services, along with extensive options for private parties and catering for events such as birthdays, corporate gatherings, and graduation parties. The atmosphere is casual and relaxed, suitable for watching sports, playing pool, enjoying karaoke, or hosting social gatherings.",
      "ambience_description": "The atmosphere is relaxed and unpretentious, centered around community, hearty food, and a classic bar experience. It is a social hub where regulars and newcomers can enjoy entertainment in an easy-going setting.",
      "amenities_description": "The venue provides a full bar and a kitchen serving hearty meals, with amenities like pool tables and sports-equipped televisions to enhance the social experience.",
      "unique_selling_points": "Known as a staple neighborhood classic for over 25 years, the venue is celebrated for its signature prime rib specials and consistently high-quality steak tips.",
      "neighborhood_description": "Situated within the central commercial district, the surroundings offer a lively and accessible environment that caters to locals and visitors alike.",
      "physical_setting_description": "Located in the heart of downtown, this spot serves as a classic neighborhood bar and grill. The interior is designed for casual socialization, featuring pool tables and multiple televisions for viewing sports.",
      "customer_demographics_description": "The restaurant serves a local crowd of regulars and neighborhood patrons who frequent the bar and cafe for casual meals, drinks, and social events.",
